          name: 'Full Backstab',
          description: "Players can ask for a card by rank AND suit. This makes the game move much slower but increases the 'memory' stakes.",
        },
      ],
      noVariationsReason: '',
    },
    aiContent: {
      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Only remembers the last two enquiries. Never uses Jokers strategically.',
        medium: "Maintains a full 'Possessions Map' of all players. Recalculates who has what every turn.",
        hard: "Sophisticated Inference Engine. If Player A asks for 5s and Player B says 'Go Fish', the AI concludes that the remaining 5s must be in the Ocean or with silent players C and D.",
      },
      considerations: [
        'The 108-card deck size requires an efficient tracking array.',
        "AI must decide when to reveal a Joker vs. keeping it to 'spy' on other ranks.",
      ],
    },
